  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 304.17 Requirements for Training Credit Hours (TCH) Courses",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 304.17 Requirements for Training Credit Hours (TCH) Courses.\n\n(a) To qualify for TCH credit, a course shall be:\n\n(1) Offered by the department;\n\n(2) Offered by a state-wide or regional professional association of wastewater treatment professionals; or\n\n(3) Approved by the department pursuant to Env-Wq 304.18.\n\n(b) For courses qualified in accordance with (a)(1)-(3) above, the department shall award TCHs in one hour increments to instructors for each hour of instructor training provided.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at part heading for Env-Wq 304) #10392, eff 8-1-13; ss by #13755, eff 9-27-23 (formerly Env-Wq 304.19) (see Revision Note #2 at part heading for Env-Wq 304)",
